---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Flutter Plugin Docs — Tester Swarm"
  description="Integrate Tester Swarm into Flutter apps with flutter pub add testerswarm and one manifest tag."
  canonicalPath="/docs/sdk/flutter"
>
  <article class="card">
    <h1>Tester Swarm Flutter Plugin</h1>
    <p>Android-only wrapper; safe no-op on iOS, Web, and Desktop. No Dart code required.</p>

    <h2>1. Install package</h2>
    <pre><code>flutter pub add testerswarm</code></pre>

    <h2>2. Add APP_KEY (<code>android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml</code>)</h2>
    <pre><code>&lt;meta-data
    android:name="dev.testerswarm.APP_KEY"
    android:value="ts_pk_your_app_key_here" /&gt;</code></pre>

    <p>Ensure <code>minSdk</code> is <strong>23 or higher</strong> in <code>android/app/build.gradle.kts</code>.</p>

    <p>
      Also available: <a href="/docs/sdk/android">Android Kotlin SDK</a> ·
      <a href="/docs/sdk/react-native">React Native Wrapper</a> ·
      <a href="/llms-full.txt">/llms-full.txt</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
